From 27f220b67eb9bfcbb863f360392ddd2262d75fc4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ben Walker <ben@nvidia.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Aug 2024 13:06:55 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 06/21] sock: Move spdk_sock_cb to group creation instead of
 when a socket is added to the group.

This means there is one global callback for the whole group, which would
seem like a major change if all of the code didn't use the same callback
for every socket in a group already.

Change-Id: I66f812c4e7b19baaa128b36e5775a82f410d5f6d
Signed-off-by: Ben Walker <ben@nvidia.com>
---
